                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">1) '[Liber] Magistri Henrici Abyndon [...] ad
                        vsum Magistri Helye Stokes amici pro [...].</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">2) '22' Nele'.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">3) '17' de sorte Nele' 2o fo Questiones de
                        concep[...?]'.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">4) '24 Irelond quest'.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">5) '27' tropologiarum'.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">These inscriptions are partly legible by
                        ordinary and partly by u.v. light.</note>
